# FlowTree — Notificações e métricas

@host = http://localhost:5100/api
@token = COLE_O_TOKEN_AQUI
@projectUuid = COLE_O_UUID_DO_PROJETO
@sprintUuid = COLE_O_UUID_DA_SPRINT
@notificationId = COLE_O_ID_DA_NOTIFICACAO

### Listar notificações (paginado)
GET {{host}}/notifications?page=1
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Quantidade de não lidas (sininho)
GET {{host}}/notifications/unread-count
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Marcar uma como lida
POST {{host}}/notifications/{{notificationId}}/read
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Marcar todas como lidas
POST {{host}}/notifications/read-all
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Excluir notificação
DELETE {{host}}/notifications/{{notificationId}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Métricas do projeto — todas as sprints + backlog
GET {{host}}/projects/{{projectUuid}}/metrics?sprint=all
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Métricas — só o Backlog
GET {{host}}/projects/{{projectUuid}}/metrics?sprint=backlog
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Métricas — uma sprint específica
GET {{host}}/projects/{{projectUuid}}/metrics?sprint={{sprintUuid}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
